  "interface": {
    "_comment": "No RF blasters, no owner name (nothing on the One shows it) and no preferences file; a theme folder instead. No Advanced pages: the device and activity properties they edit are the Harmony 900's, which the One's builder does not read. Timing offers what the builder uses - power-on delay, the delay between digits, Always on. Languages are the ones the Harmony One backend has a catalogue for (backends/harmony_one/locale).",
